	(text "Bus 12-40 V DC, 6 A FS bidirectional\nRshunt 10 mohm +/-0.5 % (WSK2512R0100DEA), Kelvin\n6 A FS: Vshunt 60.5 mV max of 163.84 mV (ADCRANGE 0)\nI error +/-0.375 % cal, +/-6.444 % uncal at 6 A (BOL worst case)\nRequirement +/-1 % at 6 A, 1-point cal (ref +/-0.1 %): PASS\nScaling 11.44 uA/count (100 A/V of Vshunt), SHUNT_CAL 1500\nShunt 0.36 W max of 1.0 W, element ~106 C (estimate)\nVBUS error +/-59.6 mV at 40 V, +/-20.4 mV at 12 V; LSB 195.3 uV\nV3V3 3.3 V +/-3 %, shared with host"
